menu "Micro OS WiFi"

    config MICRO_OS_WIFI
        bool "the WiFi station"
        default y
        help
            The portable core of the station, the radio of the port and the
            driver that registers the module and the command. A build
            without a network turns this off and links none of the three:
            the ESP-IDF WiFi stack is not asked for either.

endmenu
